  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[BetterBuildingMenu.BetterBuildingMenu.Mod.BetterBuildingMenuSettings.DevCardHeight]": "Developer mode only. How tall each card is at 100% text: 46, as it ships, three rows to the menu's height, or 50, two rows.",
